</a>
    </div>
    

    <div class="node__content">
      <div class="rel-news-date"> 13 Feb 2025 </div>
      <div class="rel-news-intro">
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-news-introduction field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The European Securities and Markets Authority (ESMA), the EU’s financial markets regulator and supervisor, has launched a <a href="/press-news/consultations/consultation-revision-disclosure-framewo"></a></p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="actionscard">
        <div class="actionscard__left">
                  </div>
        <div class="actionscard__right">
                      <div class="actionscard__right--consult">
            <div class="field field--name-field-news-consultation field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><a href="/press-news/consultations/consultation-revision-disclosure-framework-private-securitisation" hreflang="en">Consultation on the revision of the disclosure framework for private securitisation</a></div>
